è®?**Rust è§£æžä¸€æ¬?* userdata å¹?*é€šè¿‡ env ä¼ ç»™ backend**ï¼ŒPython èµ?priority-1 ç›´æŽ¥ç”?â†?åŒè§£æžå½»åº•å½’ä¸€ã€?
**2a. `paths.rs::portable_userdata_dir`** æ”¹æˆã€?*create å†è¿”å›?*ã€ï¼ˆä¸?Python å¯¹é½ï¼Œä¸å†è¦æ±‚é¢„å…ˆå­˜åœ¨ï¼‰ï¼?```rust
fn portable_userdata_dir() -> Option<PathBuf> {
    let exe = std::env::current_exe().ok()?;
    let parent = exe.parent()?;
    let root = if parent.file_name()?.to_string_lossy().eq_ignore_ascii_case("backend") {
        parent.parent()?.to_path_buf()
    } else { parent.to_path_buf() };
    let ud = root.join("userdata");
    // æŽ¢é’ˆå†™ï¼šå¯å†™æ‰è®¤ portableï¼Œå¦åˆ?Noneâ†?AppData%
    if std::fs::create_dir_all(&ud).is_ok() {
